  "releaseNotes": "RoomSharp.SqlServer 0.4.2\n            \n            - First fully working and stable SqlServer provider for RoomSharp.\n            - Fixed critical SqlServer dialect issues that made 0.4.1 effectively unusable.\n            - Aligned TypeConverter, nullable, and Boolean handling with the RoomSharp core engine.\n            - General reliability and performance improvements for SqlServer queries.\n            - Note: Previous provider releases received limited real-world testing as development focus was primarily on the SQLite-based core. This version establishes the first properly validated SqlServer provider.",
